      "id": 4,
      "passage": "<p><strong>Narrator:</strong> Technology and education.</p><p><strong>Lecturer:</strong> Some people believed that the use of e-mail between students and teachers made them interact with each other less, and that this was not a good thing.</p><p><strong>Lecturer:</strong> Moreover, there is a tight relationship with the local economy when it comes to the effectiveness of the use of IT in education.</p><p><strong>Lecturer:</strong> The most common example of teachers using technology in education is the use of computers to develop their teaching methods — in most classrooms you can see teachers using computers to present teaching notes and other materials.</p><p><strong>Lecturer:</strong> It involves a kind of software which allows students as well as teachers to talk and discuss with each other more easily, and they said they enjoy this way of communication.</p><p><strong>Lecturer:</strong> So it gives them a chance to showcase their strengths and build up their confidence.</p><p><strong>Lecturer:</strong> They don't have to wait all night trying to register for their favourite elective courses — compared with the traditional platform, it is more flexible.</p><p><strong>Lecturer:</strong> By the way, all the materials are original works of teachers or scholars, so there is no need to worry about the quality of the content.</p><p><strong>Lecturer:</strong> So this mode gives students a new search engine they can use on campus. This is a perfect example of new solutions to new problems.</p><p><strong>Lecturer:</strong> Students can arrange their daily activities and improve their time management skills by simply ticking the boxes in the timetable online.</p><p><strong>Lecturer:</strong> Another feature is that students can help people who have questions or problems relating to their field of study on a special platform. They can even earn some income by providing people with good solutions.</p>",
      "questions": "<div class=\"section-block\" id=\"listening-part-4\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div class=\"num\">Questions 31–40</div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Complete the notes below. Write <em>ONE WORD ONLY</em> for each answer.</div>\n      <h2>Technology and Education</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"note-flow\">- Some people believed <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-31\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">31</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_7_31_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 31\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_7_31\"></span></span> failed to help students interact with teachers<br>\n      <br>- IT in education develops a tight <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-32\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">32</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_7_32_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 32\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_7_32\"></span></span> with the local economy<br>\n      <br>- Computers are commonly used to develop teaching <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-33\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">33</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_7_33_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 33\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_7_33\"></span></span>\n      <div class=\"subhead\"><br>The new mode in the IT school of Westbrook University</div>- Students enjoy the <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-34\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">34</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_7_34_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 34\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_7_34\"></span></span> with teachers<br>\n      <br>- New technology builds up greater <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-35\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">35</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_7_35_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 35\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_7_35\"></span></span> for students<br>\n      <br>- Compared with traditional teaching, the new way is more <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-36\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">36</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_7_36_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 36\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_7_36\"></span></span><br>\n      <br>- It offers students quality <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-37\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">37</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_7_37_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 37\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_7_37\"></span></span><br>\n      <br>- It is seen as new solutions to new <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-38\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">38</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_7_38_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 38\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_7_38\"></span></span><br>\n      <br>- It nurtures <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-39\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">39</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_7_39_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 39\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_7_39\"></span></span> management skills<br>\n      <br>- It also provides students a source of <span class=\"gap-field\" id=\"lq-row-40\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">40</strong><input type=\"text\" id=\"practice_7_40_\" class=\"gap-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 40\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_7_40\"></span></span></div>\n  </div>",
